# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `make check` in the AddressSanitizer build
# (ASAN_OPTIONS=detect_leaks=1, LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=test/lsan.supp).
# Keep each entry narrow and say why it is here.

# Saturation over the rationals is experimental: the trace phases in
# src/neogb/modular.c do not release their copies of the basis, the hash
# tables and the matrices yet, and their results are not used.
leak:f4sat_trace_

# Unit test programs that return without freeing their fixtures (input
# data, matrices); the library code they call is checked through the
# msolve binary in the diff tests.
leak:build_matrixn_
leak:line_endings_support
